    "q-166216": {
      "dom_id": "question-166216",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }f(x).$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }f(x)=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term of the polynomial and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }(4-{x}^{2}) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }(-{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }({x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-(\\infty ) \\\\  & =-\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$",
