      "html": "<div id=\"question-166222\" class=\"question\">                                \n                        <div id=\"question-166222-text\" class=\"questionText\">      \n                            \n                            <!--<span style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;\">g.</span>-->\n\n                            <div id=\"question-166222-graphic\" class=\"questionGraphic\">\n                                \n                                    <img src=\"/graphics/q-166222\">     \n                                \n                            </div>   \n\n\n                            The graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"14\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is shown above (not drawn to scale). Estimate the area <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c41 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> using a right Riemann sum with step size <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            <div class=\"freeResponse\">\n                                                <div class=\"freeResponseLine\">\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"17\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c41 T