"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><mover><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>⏞</mo></mover></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathsize=\"1.2em\"><mtext>heights</mtext></mstyle></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><munder><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mstyle><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathsize=\"1.2em\"><mtext>width</mtext></mstyle></mrow></mstyle></mrow></munder></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, we now set up a table with the values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"37\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx