    "q-166224": {
      "dom_id": "question-166224",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "The exact value of the area $A$ from part 7 can be expressed using definite integral notation as\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $A={\\int }_{a}^{b}$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\text{d}x,\\,\\,$ where  \n$a\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n$\\,$ and $\\,b\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-3}}",
      "worked_solution": "We can express the area $A$ as the definite integral of \n\n$$\nf(x)=4-{x}^{2}\n$$\n\nbetween \n\n- the lower limit $x=0,$ and\n\n- the upper limit $x=2.$\n\nThis gives\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{0}^{2}4-{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
